          "text": "A\ncanonical\nexample\nof\na\nTMD\nhosting\nboth\nsuperconductivity and a CDW is pristine 2H-NbSe2,\nwhich undergoes a superconducting transition at 7 K and\na CDW transition at 31 K [25–27].",
