          "evidence_ids": [
            "e15"
          ],
          "context_evidence_ids": [],
          "text": "Furthermore, BiFeO3 has a bandgap in the range 2.2 −2.6eV\n[12], which is a\nrelatively small value when compared to other ferroelectric materials.",
          "pages": [
            2
          ]
        },
        {
          "candidate_index": 1,
          "role": "cited_result",
          "reason": "explicit_prior_work_context",
          "evidence_ids": [
            "e16"
          ],
          "context_evidence_ids": [
            "e54"
          ],
          "text": "In recent work, Wafa Amdouni and collaborators [1] investigated the piezo-\nphotocatalytic properties of BiFeO3 nanoparticles with 60 nm size.",
          "pages": [
            2
          ]
        },
        {
          "candidate_index": 2,
          "role": "cited_result",
          "reason": "explicit_prior_work_context",
          "evidence_ids": [
            "e17"
          ],
          "context_evidence_ids": [
            "e55"
          ],
          "text": "The results show\nthat in approximately 30 minutes, the BiFeO3 nanoparticles successfully degraded 97%\nof the Rhodamine B, a model aqueous organic dye pollutant, using only the piezo-\ncatalytic effect.",
          "pages": [
            2
          ]
        },
        {
          "candidate_index": 3,
          "role": "simulation_parameter",
          "reason": "computational_procedure",
          "evidence_ids": [
            "e18"
          ],
          "context_evidence_ids": [],
          "text": "A temperature of 1 K was\nchosen to facilitate effective relaxation while introducing a minimal amount of thermal\nnoise.",
          "pages": [
            4
          ]
        },
        {
          "candidate_index": 4,
          "role": "own_result",
          "reason": "current_result_statement",
          "evidence_ids": [
            "e21"
          ],
          "context_evidence_ids": [],
          "text": "At the center of this cut of the nanoparticle, the volume of the\nunit cell is approximately 1% smaller than the average volume in the nanoparticle.",
          "pages": [
            4
          ]
        },
